# Design references — local inputs, not source.
# 4.4MB of PNG screenshots and generated HTML that nothing imports and no test
# reads. They stay on disk as the design source of truth; git is the wrong place
# for binaries that are re-exported rather than edited.
# Already in this repo's history, so ignoring them does not remove them from it.
references/
